---
// Hero.astro - Core Hero section with avatar and floating chat bubbles
---

<header class="hero-container">
  <!-- Social Icons Top Right -->
  <div class="social-header">
    <a href="https://github.com/RogelioLB" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="GitHub de Rogelio" class="social-icon-link">
      <svg class="svg-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
        <path d="M12 2A10 10 0 0 0 2 12c0 4.42 2.87 8.17 6.84 9.5.5.08.66-.23.66-.5v-1.69c-2.77.6-3.36-1.34-3.36-1.34-.46-1.16-1.11-1.47-1.11-1.47-.9-.62.07-.6.07-.6 1 .07 1.53 1.03 1.53 1.03.9 1.52 2.34 1.07 2.91.83.09-.65.35-1.09.63-1.34-2.22-.25-4.55-1.11-4.55-4.92 0-1.11.38-2 1.03-2.71-.1-.25-.45-1.29.1-2.64 0 0 .84-.27 2.75 1.02.79-.22 1.65-.33 2.5-.33.85 0 1.71.11 2.5.33 1.91-1.29 2.75-1.02 2.75-1.02.55 1.35.2 2.39.1 2.64.65.71 1.03 1.6 1.03 2.71 0 3.82-2.34 4.66-4.57 4.91.36.31.69.92.69 1.85V21c0 .27.16.59.67.5C19.14 20.16 22 16.42 22 12A10 10 0 0 0 12 2z"/>
      </svg>
    </a>
    <a href="https://twitter.com/RogelioLB" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Twitter de Rogelio" class="social-icon-link">
      <svg class="svg-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
        <path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/>
      </svg>
    </a>
  </div>

  <!-- Avatar & Floating Bubbles Area -->
  <div class="avatar-interactive-wrapper">
    <div class="avatar-wrapper">
      <!-- Real high-quality avatar image with shine overlay -->
      <div class="avatar-image-container">
        <img src="/avatar.png" alt="Rogelio López" class="avatar-image" />
        <div class="avatar-shine"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Speech Bubble 1: Disponible para trabajar (Top Right) -->
    <div class="speech-bubble bubble-green float-slow">
      <span class="pulse-dot"></span>
      <span class="bubble-text">Disponible para trabajar</span>
      <div class="bubble-tail tail-bottom-left"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Speech Bubble 2: 👋 Hola, soy Rogelio (Middle Right) -->
    <div class="speech-bubble bubble-white float-medium">
      <span class="bubble-text bold-text"><span class="hand-wave">👋</span> Hola, soy Rogelio</span>
      <div class="bubble-tail tail-left"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Speech Bubble 3: Desarrollador Web (Bottom) -->
    <div class="speech-bubble bubble-purple float-fast">
      <span class="bubble-text purple-text">Desarrollador Web</span>
      <div class="bubble-tail tail-top-left"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Intro Bio text -->
  <div class="intro-content">
    <p class="profile-paragraph">
      Ingeniero de Software especializado en desarrollo full-stack con <strong>JavaScript/TypeScript</strong>. Experiencia construyendo productos SaaS, sistemas multi-tenant, integraciones de pagos con <strong>Mercado Pago</strong> y automatizaciones con <strong>WhatsApp Business API</strong>. Me caracterizo por el aprendizaje continuo, proactividad y capacidad para entregar soluciones escalables de principio a fin, desde la base de datos hasta la interfaz de usuario.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Action CTA Buttons -->
  <div class="cta-actions">
    <a href="#contacto" class="btn btn-outline" id="cta-contact">
      <svg class="btn-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"/>
      </svg>
      Contactame
    </a>
    <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/rogeliolb" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-outline" id="cta-linkedin">
      <svg class="btn-icon" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
        <path d="M19 0h-14c-2.761 0-5 2.239-5 5v14c0 2.761 2.239 5 5 5h14c2.762 0 5-2.239 5-5v-14c0-2.761-2.238-5-5-5zm-11 19h-3v-11h3v11zm-1.5-12.268c-.966 0-1.75-.779-1.75-1.75s.784-1.75 1.75-1.75 1.75.779 1.75 1.75-.784 1.75-1.75 1.75zm13.5 12.268h-3v-5.604c0-3.368-4-3.113-4 0v5.604h-3v-11h3v1.765c1.396-2.586 7-2.777 7 2.476v6.759z"/>
      </svg>
      LinkedIn
    </a>
  </div>
</header>

<style>
  .hero-container {
    max-width: 880px; /* Expanded from 768px to minimize empty margins and scale up the hero */
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3.5rem 2rem 4.5rem 2rem; /* Increased vertical and horizontal padding */
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    position: relative;
  }

  /* Social Icons header */
  .social-header {
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .social-icon-link {
    color: var(--text-main);
    opacity: 0.8;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .social-icon-link:hover {
    color: var(--primary);
    opacity: 1;
    transform: scale(1.1);
  }

  .svg-icon {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
  }

  /* Interactive Avatar & Floating Bubbles Area */
  .avatar-interactive-wrapper {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 540px; /* Expanded space for left-aligned scaled up avatar and bubbles */
    height: 320px; /* Centered height to accommodate scaled up avatar & bubbles beautifully */
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  /* Avatar Styling */
  .avatar-wrapper {
    position: absolute;
    left: 20px; /* Placed left of the bubbles */
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%); /* Centered vertically relative to the speech bubbles */
    width: 195px; /* Enlarged significantly for a premium bold presentation */
    height: 195px; /* Enlarged significantly */
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7C3AED 0%, #D8B4FE 100%);
    padding: 5px; /* Premium thicker gradient ring */
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-avatar);
    z-index: 10;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }
  
  .avatar-wrapper:hover {
    transform: translateY(-50%) scale(1.05) rotate(2deg);
  }

  .avatar-image-container {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: 50%;
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
  }

  .avatar-image {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  .avatar-shine {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: -50%;
    width: 200%;
    height: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(
      to right,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 0%,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15) 50%,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 100%
    );
    transform: rotate(30deg);
    animation: shine 4s infinite linear;
  }

  @keyframes shine {
    0% { left: -100%; }
    100% { left: 100%; }
  }

  /* Universal Speech Bubble Styles */
  .speech-bubble {
    position: absolute;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.8rem 1.4rem; /* Slightly larger padding for premium feel */
    border-radius: var(--border-radius-full);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-bubble);
    z-index: 20;
    user-select: none;
    transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
  }

  .speech-bubble:hover {
    transform: scale(1.05) translateY(-3px) !important;
    box-shadow: 0 25px 30px -5px rgba(109, 40, 217, 0.12), 0 12px 15px -6px rgba(109, 40, 217, 0.12);
  }

  .bubble-text {
    font-family: var(--font-headers);
    font-size: 0.95rem; /* Marginally larger text */
    font-weight: 500;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .bold-text {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.2rem; /* Marginally larger bold text */
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .purple-text {
    color: var(--primary);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* Bubble 1: Disponible para trabajar (Top Right of Avatar) */
  .bubble-green {
    background: var(--green-bg);
    border: 1px solid rgba(134, 239, 172, 0.3);
    color: var(--green-text);
    top: 25px;
    left: 170px; /* Floating elegantly above and to the right of the larger avatar */
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
  }

  /* Bubble 2: 👋 Hola, soy Rogelio (Middle Right of Avatar) */
  .bubble-white {
    background: var(--white-bg);
    border: 1px solid rgba(109, 40, 217, 0.05);
    padding: 1rem 1.6rem; /* Scaled up padding */
    top: 131px; /* Perfectly centered vertically with the 195px avatar */
    left: 245px; /* Positioned to the right of the larger avatar */
  }

  .hand-wave {
    display: inline-block;
    animation: wave 2.5s infinite;
    transform-origin: 70% 70%;
  }

  @keyframes wave {
    0% { transform: rotate( 0.0deg) }
    10% { transform: rotate(14.0deg) }
    20% { transform: rotate(-8.0deg) }
    30% { transform: rotate(14.0deg) }
    40% { transform: rotate(-4.0deg) }
    50% { transform: rotate(10.0deg) }
    60% { transform: rotate( 0.0deg) }
    100% { transform: rotate( 0.0deg) }
  }

  /* Bubble 3: Desarrollador Web (Bottom of Avatar) */
  .bubble-purple {
    background: var(--white-bg);
    border: 1px solid rgba(109, 40, 217, 0.05);
    left: 130px; /* Clean overlay position overlapping the bottom-right of the avatar */
    bottom: 25px;
  }

  /* Speech Bubble Tails */
  .bubble-tail {
    position: absolute;
    width: 0;
    height: 0;
    border-style: solid;
  }

  /* Green bubble pointer (bottom-left pointing towards avatar) */
  .tail-bottom-left {
    bottom: -8px;
    left: 20px;
    border-width: 8px 8px 0 0;
    border-color: rgba(220, 252, 231, 0.9) transparent transparent transparent;
  }

  /* White bubble pointer (left pointing to avatar) */
  .tail-left {
    left: -9px;
    top: calc(50% - 6px);
    border-width: 6px 10px 6px 0;
    border-color: transparent var(--white-bg) transparent transparent;
  }

  /* Purple bubble pointer (top-left pointing to avatar) */
  .tail-top-left {
    top: -8px;
    left: 25px;
    border-width: 0 8px 8px 0;
    border-color: transparent transparent var(--white-bg) transparent;
  }

  /* Biography text styling */
  .intro-content {
    margin-top: 1.5rem; /* Marginally increased spacing */
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    text-align: left;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .profile-paragraph {
    font-size: 1.15rem; /* Scaled up from 1.05rem for bold premium presentation */
    color: var(--text-main);
    line-height: 1.8; /* Increased line-height for absolute readability */
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .profile-paragraph strong {
    color: var(--primary-light);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* Actions CTA buttons styling */
  .cta-actions {
    display: flex;
    width: 100%;
    justify-content: flex-start;
    gap: 1.5rem; /* Scaled gap */
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    padding: 0.95rem 1.9rem; /* Scaled up button padding */
    border-radius: var(--border-radius-full);
    font-family: var(--font-headers);
    font-size: 1.05rem; /* Scaled up button text size */
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .btn-outline {
    background-color: var(--white-bg);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--primary-light);
    color: var(--primary-light);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(109, 40, 217, 0.05);
  }

  .btn-outline:hover {
    background-color: var(--primary-light);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.2);
  }

  .btn-icon {
    width: 20px; /* Marginally larger icons */
    height: 20px;
  }

  /* Responsive Adjustments */
  @media (max-width: 500px) {
    .avatar-interactive-wrapper {
      height: 270px; /* Scaled up from 230px */
      max-width: 375px; /* Wider content area for mobile */
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .avatar-wrapper {
      width: 140px; /* Larger vertically centered avatar on mobile (was 120px) */
      height: 140px;
      left: 10px;
      top: 50%;
      transform: translateY(-50%);
    }

    .avatar-wrapper:hover {
      transform: translateY(-50%) scale(1.05) rotate(2deg);
    }



    .bubble-green {
      left: 120px;
      top: 15px;
      padding: 0.55rem 1.05rem;
    }
    
    .bubble-green .bubble-text {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
    }

    .bubble-white {
      left: 175px; /* Adjusted left position on mobile to prevent overflow */
      top: 115px; /* Perfectly centered vertically with the 140px avatar on mobile */
      padding: 0.55rem 1.05rem; /* Slightly reduced padding to save space */
    }

    .bold-text {
      font-size: 0.95rem; /* Marginally larger text size to fit viewport comfortably */
    }

    .bubble-purple {
      left: 95px;
      bottom: 20px;
      padding: 0.55rem 1.05rem;
    }
    
    .bubble-purple .bubble-text {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
    }

    .profile-paragraph {
      font-size: 1.1rem; /* Slightly larger paragraph on mobile */
    }

    .cta-actions {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .btn {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 0.95rem 1.9rem;
    }
  }
</style>
